    (globalFirstRowCap (Ksrc/Z^η) (X/B^3) (Real.exp 1*B) F)^deltaLoss *
      ((Real.exp 1*B)*(reopeningScaleConstant A M*Z^4))^ε ≤
      (((Real.exp 1)^8)^deltaLoss*(reopeningScaleConstant A M^2)^ε)*Z^(13*deltaLoss+7*ε) := by
