      (reopeningScaleConstant A M*Z^4)^(deltaLoss+8*ε) ≤
      (((Real.exp 1)^8)^deltaLoss*(reopeningScaleConstant A M)^(deltaLoss+8*ε))*Z^(17*deltaLoss+32*ε) := by
